      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.05,
          "end": 3.34,
          "en": "Now, whilst we're not going",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.34,
          "end": 6.59,
          "en": "to proceed on this DetailPage for the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.59,
          "end": 9.1,
          "en": "whilst we're not going to dive into data fetching",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.1,
          "end": 12.8,
          "en": "for the moment, I wanna come back to this index.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.8,
          "end": 15.85,
          "en": "in the news folder and talk about navigation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.85,
          "end": 17.95,
          "en": "because currently, I, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.95,
          "end": 22.42,
          "en": "always enter URLs in the URL bar manually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.42,
          "end": 26.29,
          "en": "and that, of course, is not how users use our website.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.29,
          "end": 28.53,
          "en": "Instead, we have links on our website",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.53,
          "end": 31.29,
          "en": "that allow users to navigate around.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.29,
          "end": 34.67,
          "en": "Hence here on this index.js file in the news page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.67,
          "end": 36.85,
          "en": "so on /news page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.85,
          "end": 40,
          "en": "we typically don't just wanna say The News Page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40,
          "end": 42.38,
          "en": "but we might also want to display a list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.38,
          "end": 45.42,
          "en": "of news items, which are then clickable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.42,
          "end": 48.35,
          "en": "And to do that, I'll wrap this here in a Fragment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.35,
          "end": 50.29,
          "en": "which I import from React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 50.29,
          "end": 53.603,
          "en": "so that we can have a JSON JSX element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.66,
          "end": 57.63,
          "en": "And render a unordered list here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.63,
          "end": 58.87,
          "en": "And in that unordered list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.87,
          "end": 62.113,
          "en": "we could have well, a list of dummy news items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 62.96,
          "end": 67.96,
          "en": "For example, the NextJS Is A Great Framework article",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.12,
          "end": 71.95,
          "en": "and then also the Something else article.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.95,
          "end": 72.783,
          "en": "Whatever.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 72.783,
          "end": 74.72,
          "en": "So we have two news items here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.72,
          "end": 76.68,
          "en": "and these should now be clickable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 76.68,
          "end": 81.68,
          "en": "and then lead to the newsId page with different IDs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 81.78999999999999,
          "end": 85.94,
          "en": "different concrete values encoded in the URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 85.94,
          "end": 87.42,
          "en": "Now, when we wanna build a link,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 87.42,
          "end": 90.47,
          "en": "we typically do this by using the anchor tag.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 90.47,
          "end": 92.63,
          "en": "We can create an anchor element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 92.63,
          "end": 95.62,
          "en": "and wrap our text with that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 95.62,
          "end": 98.97999999999999,
          "en": "And then here, we can encode the URL",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 98.97999999999999,
          "end": 100.66,
          "en": "to which we wanna go.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 100.66,
          "end": 103.7,
          "en": "So in this case, if we wanna stay on this server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 103.7,
          "end": 106.69,
          "en": "we could say we're going to /news/",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 106.69,
          "end": 110.88,
          "en": "and then nextjs-is-a-great-framework",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 110.88,
          "end": 114.313,
          "en": "if that would be the identifier of this news item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 115.17,
          "end": 118.17,
          "en": "And of course, this list could also be generated dynamically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 118.17,
          "end": 121.81,
          "en": "by mapping some array of data into JSX elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 121.81,
          "end": 123.29,
          "en": "I'm just hard coding it here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 123.29,
          "end": 124.53,
          "en": "because for the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 124.53,
          "end": 127.76,
          "en": "I wanna focus on the navigation feature.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 127.76,
          "end": 129.88,
          "en": "So that is how we do construct a link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 129.88,
          "end": 132.35,
          "en": "in regular HTML",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 132.35,
          "end": 135.59,
          "en": "and if we save this, it also will work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 135.59,
          "end": 138.96,
          "en": "If I go back to the /news page here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 138.96,
          "end": 141.07,
          "en": "we actually don't see that it's a link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 141.07,
          "end": 143.32999999999998,
          "en": "because in the globals.css file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 143.32999999999998,
          "end": 146.03,
          "en": "I basically disabled the default styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 146.03,
          "end": 148.25,
          "en": "that would show you that it's a link.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 148.25,
          "end": 149.63,
          "en": "But we can click it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 149.63,
          "end": 153.82,
          "en": "and if I do click it, I am taken to that detail page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 153.82,
          "end": 155.82,
          "en": "for that specific value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 155.82,
          "end": 157.123,
          "en": "So that is working.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 158.15,
          "end": 161.05,
          "en": "But this is only the second best way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 161.05,
          "end": 164.3,
          "en": "of navigating around in a NextJS app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 164.3,
          "end": 167.53,
          "en": "It works but watch this refresh icon here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 167.53,
          "end": 169.32,
          "en": "when I click this link.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 169.32,
          "end": 171.51,
          "en": "It briefly turns to a cross",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 171.51,
          "end": 174.55,
          "en": "and then goes back to the refresh icon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 174.55,
          "end": 178.4,
          "en": "This always signals that the browser sends a new request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 178.4,
          "end": 182.02,
          "en": "and gets back a new HTML page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 182.02,
          "end": 185.41,
          "en": "And that all works but it has a disadvantage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 185.41,
          "end": 189.14,
          "en": "It means that we don't have a single page application here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 189.14,
          "end": 192.35,
          "en": "It means instead that we're always sending a new request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 192.35,
          "end": 195.74,
          "en": "to the backend to fetch a new HTML page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 195.74,
          "end": 198.24,
          "en": "whenever the user navigates around.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 198.24,
          "end": 200.43,
          "en": "And that's not our goal here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 200.43,
          "end": 203.72,
          "en": "It's great that we have those pre-rendered pages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 203.72,
          "end": 206.93,
          "en": "so that when a user initially visits our site,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 206.93,
          "end": 209.47,
          "en": "some content is there right from the start",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 209.47,
          "end": 211.96,
          "en": "and it's also great for search engines",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 211.96,
          "end": 214.42000000000002,
          "en": "but if a user is on the page already",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 214.42000000000002,
          "end": 216.27,
          "en": "and then navigates around on it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 216.27,
          "end": 219.59,
          "en": "we wanna stay in that single page application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 219.59,
          "end": 222.46,
          "en": "because that allows us to preserve state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 222.46,
          "end": 225.63,
          "en": "across pages and give the user a better,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 225.63,
          "end": 230.57,
          "en": "a more reactive experience, a better user experience.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 230.57,
          "end": 234.01,
          "en": "That, after all, is one of the reasons for using React,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 234.01,
          "end": 236.63,
          "en": "that we wanna build an interactive UI",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 236.63,
          "end": 241.04,
          "en": "where we never send a request for a new HTML page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 241.04,
          "end": 244.22,
          "en": "but where we instead update what's on the screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 244.22,
          "end": 247.72,
          "en": "with JavaScript, with React in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 247.72,
          "end": 249.22,
          "en": "And we're not doing this here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 249.22,
          "end": 250.95,
          "en": "when we create a link like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 250.95,
          "end": 253.3,
          "en": "Instead, we load a brand new page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 253.3,
          "end": 256.41,
          "en": "We would lose any state we might be storing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 256.41,
          "end": 259.09,
          "en": "any Redux sate or context state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 259.09,
          "end": 260.5,
          "en": "all of that would be lost",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 260.5,
          "end": 262.28,
          "en": "because we load a new page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 262.28,
          "end": 266.4,
          "en": "And we simply don't have a single page application here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 266.4,
          "end": 269.75,
          "en": "Therefore, to stay in that single page application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 269.75,
          "end": 271.99,
          "en": "we need to create the link differently.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 271.99,
          "end": 275.51,
          "en": "We need to utilize a special component offered by Next,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 275.51,
          "end": 279.34000000000003,
          "en": "to be precise, offered by next/link.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 279.34000000000003,
          "end": 282.68,
          "en": "That's another sub-package which is responsible for linking",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 282.68,
          "end": 286.25,
          "en": "and from there, we can import Link actually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 286.25,
          "end": 289.03,
          "en": "as a default export.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 289.03,
          "end": 292.65999999999997,
          "en": "So importing the default export like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 292.65999999999997,
          "end": 295.95,
          "en": "This imports the Link component from next/link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 295.95,
          "end": 297.54,
          "en": "and that's a special component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 297.54,
          "end": 301.28,
          "en": "which we can use in our JSX code to build links.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 301.28,
          "end": 302.55,
          "en": "Using it is simple.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 302.55,
          "end": 305.39,
          "en": "You simply use it instead of the anchor tag here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 305.39,
          "end": 308.74,
          "en": "So I replace a with Link.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 308.74,
          "end": 311.62,
          "en": "We leave the ref attribute, the ref prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 311.62,
          "end": 314.74,
          "en": "because Link expects a ref prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 314.74,
          "end": 319.13,
          "en": "And that then sets the target destination of that link.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 319.13,
          "end": 322.72,
          "en": "It will also then by default render an anchor element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 322.72,
          "end": 324.09,
          "en": "So all that will still work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 324.09,
          "end": 326.25,
          "en": "Our styling will still apply.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 326.25,
          "end": 328.85,
          "en": "Yet, if I save and reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 328.85,
          "end": 332.4,
          "en": "if I now click this and you watch the refresh icon,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 332.4,
          "end": 335.89,
          "en": "you see that now this never changes to a cross.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 335.89,
          "end": 338.61,
          "en": "Now we instantly go to the second page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 338.61,
          "end": 343.61,
          "en": "and now we go there without fetching a new HTML page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 343.89,
          "end": 346.98,
          "en": "Instead we are on a single page application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 346.98,
          "end": 349.47,
          "en": "and the visible content on the screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 349.47,
          "end": 352.62,
          "en": "is actually just re-rendered by React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 352.62,
          "end": 354.97,
          "en": "And that's great because that allows us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 354.97,
          "end": 357.40999999999997,
          "en": "to combine the best of both worlds.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 357.40999999999997,
          "end": 359.25,
          "en": "We have this highly interactive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 359.25,
          "end": 362.29,
          "en": "and reactive single page application here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 362.29,
          "end": 365.94,
          "en": "where we can manage and store state across pages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 365.94,
          "end": 368.32,
          "en": "and yet, if a user would visit this page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 368.32,
          "end": 371.65,
          "en": "as an initial page by just entering this URL",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 371.65,
          "end": 374.05,
          "en": "and hitting Enter, we would also be able",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 374.05,
          "end": 377.03,
          "en": "to return the finished HTML page here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 377.03,
          "end": 380.01,
          "en": "So search engines would also see that finished page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 380.01,
          "end": 381.92,
          "en": "if they directly visit it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 381.92,
          "end": 383.92,
          "en": "But if we were on the website already,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 383.92,
          "end": 385.28,
          "en": "and we just clicked the link,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 385.28,
          "end": 387.09,
          "en": "we stay on that single page app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
